{
  "name": "cycle",
  "domain": "architecture",
  "format": "module-graph-and-adr",
  "description": "真的存在一个环：a → b → c → a。另有一个模块 d 依赖 a，但没有任何模块依赖 d，所以经过 d 的边不在环上。这个 fixture 的用途是证明「环依赖」这一类主张是被依赖图重算出来的，而不是只要边存在就算成立 —— d → a 这条边确实存在，但环的主张在图上不成立。",
  "input": {
    "format": "module-graph-and-adr",
    "payload": {
      "modules": [
        { "id": "a", "path": "src/a/a.ts", "dependsOn": ["b"], "layer": "application" },
        { "id": "b", "path": "src/b/b.ts", "dependsOn": ["c"], "layer": "domain" },
        { "id": "c", "path": "src/c/c.ts", "dependsOn": ["a"], "layer": "infrastructure" },
        { "id": "d", "path": "src/d/d.ts", "dependsOn": ["a"], "layer": "infrastructure" }
      ],
      "adrs": []
    }
  },
  "expect": {
    "candidates": 4,
    "paths": ["src/a/a.ts", "src/b/b.ts", "src/c/c.ts", "src/d/d.ts"],
    "admitted": 4,
    "excludedByPredicate": {},
    "bounded": true,
    "truncated": false,
    "bundleKeys": ["src/a/a.ts", "src/b/b.ts", "src/c/c.ts", "src/d/d.ts"]
  },
  "anchors": {
    "positive": [
      {
        "note": "环依赖：引擎从图里重算出一条完整回路 a → b → c → a，主张成立。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "module-and-adr",
          "path": "src/a/a.ts",
          "locator": { "kind": "dependency-edge", "path": "src/a/a.ts", "moduleId": "a", "targetId": "b", "findingKind": "cycle" },
          "excerpt": "a -> b"
        },
        "subject": {
          "modules": [
            { "id": "a", "path": "src/a/a.ts", "dependsOn": ["b"], "layer": "application" },
            { "id": "b", "path": "src/b/b.ts", "dependsOn": ["c"], "layer": "domain" },
            { "id": "c", "path": "src/c/c.ts", "dependsOn": ["a"], "layer": "infrastructure" }
          ],
          "adrs": []
        },
        "expectStatus": "anchored",
        "expectTier": "recomputed-unique"
      }
    ],
    "negative": [
      {
        "note": "这条边存在，但没有任何回路经过 d：「存在环依赖」的主张与图矛盾，必须判未锚定。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "module-and-adr",
          "path": "src/d/d.ts",
          "locator": { "kind": "dependency-edge", "path": "src/d/d.ts", "moduleId": "d", "targetId": "a", "findingKind": "cycle" },
          "excerpt": "d -> a"
        },
        "subject": {
          "modules": [
            { "id": "a", "path": "src/a/a.ts", "dependsOn": ["b"], "layer": "application" },
            { "id": "b", "path": "src/b/b.ts", "dependsOn": ["c"], "layer": "domain" },
            { "id": "c", "path": "src/c/c.ts", "dependsOn": ["a"], "layer": "infrastructure" },
            { "id": "d", "path": "src/d/d.ts", "dependsOn": ["a"], "layer": "infrastructure" }
          ],
          "adrs": []
        },
        "expectStatus": "unanchored",
        "expectTier": "locator-mismatch"
      },
      {
        "note": "把环写错一环：抄写的规范形式与图重算出的不一致，判未锚定的更早一级（no-match），不进入图重算。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "module-and-adr",
          "path": "src/a/a.ts",
          "locator": { "kind": "dependency-edge", "path": "src/a/a.ts", "moduleId": "a", "targetId": "b", "findingKind": "cycle" },
          "excerpt": "a -> c"
        },
        "subject": {
          "modules": [
            { "id": "a", "path": "src/a/a.ts", "dependsOn": ["b"], "layer": "application" },
            { "id": "b", "path": "src/b/b.ts", "dependsOn": ["c"], "layer": "domain" },
            { "id": "c", "path": "src/c/c.ts", "dependsOn": ["a"], "layer": "infrastructure" }
          ],
          "adrs": []
        },
        "expectStatus": "unanchored",
        "expectTier": "no-match"
      }
    ]
  }
}
